00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.929
Read outside your comfort zone

00:05:39.929 --> 00:05:41.612
and write a lot.

00:05:41.612 --> 00:05:44.691
- Let's talk about that
initiation of the dream.

00:05:44.691 --> 00:05:46.384
How did that start and
how'd that come about?

00:05:46.384 --> 00:05:48.122
- I'd started a business before

00:05:48.122 --> 00:05:52.367
that I raised four million
bucks of other people's money,

00:05:52.367 --> 00:05:55.638
started a web marketing company,

00:05:55.638 --> 00:05:58.613
went boom and bust with the
first dot com boom and bust.

00:05:58.613 --> 00:06:00.877
I knew I wanted to make
it as an entrepreneur

00:06:00.877 --> 00:06:01.797
and start another business

00:06:01.797 --> 00:06:04.344
but I had no idea what I wanted to do.

00:06:04.344 --> 00:06:07.594
And so for inspiration, I went surfing.

00:06:08.504 --> 00:06:10.847
And I planned a five month
surf trip around Australia

00:06:10.847 --> 00:06:12.343
and Indonesia.

00:06:12.343 --> 00:06:14.535
The inspiration came before I even left.

00:06:14.535 --> 00:06:18.847
I wanted to capture photos
of myself and my friends

00:06:18.847 --> 00:06:20.311
that I was going on the trip with,

00:06:20.311 --> 00:06:22.519
while we were surfing out in the water

00:06:22.519 --> 00:06:25.935
and no camera existed that
allowed you to do that.

00:06:25.935 --> 00:06:28.713
And so I set out to
develop this wrist harness

00:06:28.713 --> 00:06:31.529
that I could put a single
use disposable camera into

00:06:31.529 --> 00:06:32.946
and surf with it.

00:06:33.903 --> 00:06:36.719
And I didn't even mean
it to be a business idea.

00:06:36.719 --> 00:06:40.055
I just wanted to document
my experience on this trip.

00:06:40.055 --> 00:06:42.559
And as soon as I got it working well,

00:06:42.559 --> 00:06:44.864
the light bulb went off and I realized,

00:06:44.864 --> 00:06:48.413
oh my God, there must be so
many other surfers in the world

00:06:48.413 --> 00:06:49.749
that want 6something like this .

00:06:49.749 --> 00:06:51.896
- So you sewed it with
wrist straps essentially.

00:06:51.896 --> 00:06:54.584
But how do you go from wrist
straps, which are very simple,

00:06:54.584 --> 00:06:56.448
to hardware and to actually
developing a camera.

00:06:56.448 --> 00:06:59.569
- I wanted to use higher quality
cameras with my wrist strap

00:06:59.569 --> 00:07:01.200
to capture higher quality photos

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:04.913
but every camera that I would
use with the strap surfing,

00:07:04.913 --> 00:07:06.512
I would break the camera.

00:07:06.512 --> 00:07:10.008
Because cameras weren't
designed to be used

00:07:10.008 --> 00:07:12.438
during rigorous activities like surfing.

00:07:12.438 --> 00:07:16.086
And what I ended up doing
was I spent two years

00:07:16.086 --> 00:07:19.992
gong to trade shows, the camera
trade shows around the world

00:07:19.992 --> 00:07:21.708
to look for a camera that was close

00:07:21.708 --> 00:07:24.836
to what I would want to design.

00:07:24.836 --> 00:07:26.919
After a year and a half, about a year,

00:07:26.919 --> 00:07:28.576
I found it.

00:07:28.576 --> 00:07:29.409
And

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:34.745
got the manufacturer to agree
to make the modifications

00:07:34.745 --> 00:07:37.000
and begin building the cameras for me.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:37.833
I actually did the deal

00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:40.568
without ever needing the actual company.

00:07:40.568 --> 00:07:41.412
It was all email.

00:07:41.412 --> 00:07:42.697
I had one phone call

00:07:42.697 --> 00:07:44.311
where we could barely
understand each other

00:07:44.311 --> 00:07:45.679
because of language barrier.

00:07:45.679 --> 00:07:47.039
- Were they Chinese?
- They're in Chen Zen.

00:07:47.039 --> 00:07:49.956
- I wired my $5,000 for the tool to

00:07:53.047 --> 00:07:54.660
the mold to be made

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.303
cause it was actually cheaper
just to wire five grand

00:07:58.303 --> 00:07:59.659
than to fly over there, meet them,

00:07:59.659 --> 00:08:00.747
have a business trip

00:08:00.747 --> 00:08:02.795
and I just figured okay,
well just go for it

00:08:02.795 --> 00:08:05.563
and they ended up being legitimate

00:08:05.563 --> 00:08:06.981
and we were profitable from day one

00:08:06.981 --> 00:08:09.406
because it was just me, one employee.

00:08:09.406 --> 00:08:11.003
We just had no overhead

00:08:11.003 --> 00:08:14.615
and rolled one good
production run into another

00:08:14.615 --> 00:08:15.822
and slowly scaled it

00:08:15.822 --> 00:08:19.935
and the Go Pro that everybody knows today

00:08:19.935 --> 00:08:23.185
has been built on $265,000 of capital.

00:09:10.701 --> 00:09:12.446
- [Narrator] Japan beer and German beer

00:09:12.446 --> 00:09:13.279
but no China beer.

00:09:13.279 --> 00:09:15.703
So was curious and I typed China.

00:09:15.703 --> 00:09:16.631
No China.

00:09:16.631 --> 00:09:17.593
No data.

00:09:17.593 --> 00:09:19.343
Came back to Hangzhou

00:09:21.253 --> 00:09:23.318
with one dollar in my pocket,

00:09:23.318 --> 00:09:25.278
scared, worried

00:09:25.278 --> 00:09:26.169
and I came back

00:09:26.169 --> 00:09:29.303
and I said I want to do
something called internet.

